Title: Offices on the Ballot | Chicago Board of Elections

URL Source: https://chicagoelections.gov/voting/offices-ballot

Final URL: https://chicagoelections.gov/offices-ballot

Markdown Content:
**The next election in Chicago is the November 3, 2026 Midterm General Election.**

Voters will **ELECT**candidates for:

*   US Senator
*   Illinois Governor and Lieutenant Governor
*   Illinois Attorney General
*   Illinois Secretary of State
*   Illinois Comptroller
*   Illinois Treasurer
*   Representatives in Congress
*   State Senator
*   Representatives in the General Assembly
*   Commissioners of the Metropolitan Water Reclamation District of Greater Chicago
*   President of the Cook County Board of Commissioners
*   County Clerk of Cook County
*   Sheriff of Cook County
*   Treasurer of Cook County
*   Assessor of Cook County
*   County Commissioners of Cook County
*   Commissioner of the Board of Review of Cook County
*   Illinois Appellate Court
*   Cook County Circuit and Subcircuit Judges
*   President of the Chicago Board of Education
*   Members of the Chicago Board of Education

And **DECIDE**:

*   Retention Questions to Decide Whether Judges Shall Continue to Serve
*   Any State, City or Local Referenda Questions
